# Cloudflare Pages redirects
#
# Canonicalisation. Every canonical, og:url and sitemap entry on this site points
# at the www host over https, so the apex must 301 there or Google sees two hosts
# serving identical pages and has to pick one itself.
#
# NOTE: this file only runs for requests that actually reach the Pages project,
# so it is the belt, not the braces. The braces are a zone-level Redirect Rule —
# see DEPLOY.md. Attach ONLY www.peacemakerbrewster.com as the Pages custom
# domain and let the rule handle the apex.

https://peacemakerbrewster.com/* https://www.peacemakerbrewster.com/:splat 301!
http://peacemakerbrewster.com/*  https://www.peacemakerbrewster.com/:splat 301!
